Browser client that invokes a standard Printer server through a Glacier2 router.
The browser only connects to the router (using WebSocket), the router forwards
the invocations to the server.

Procedure:

- Install DEPENDS
- Run a Printer server (any language):
  py$ make run-server
- Run the router:
  js-glacier$ make start-glacier
- Serve the web page:
  js-glacier$ make run-server
- Open http://localhost:8080, adjust the printer proxy if needed and click "Send"
